# Braille logo art is embedded verbatim via include_str!: CRLF would leak
# into the binary on Windows checkouts and render as stray carriage returns.
crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager/assets/logo/*.txt text eol=lf

# Guide docs are embedded verbatim via include_str!: force LF like the logo assets.
crates/codegen/xai-grok-pager/docs/user-guide/*.md text eol=lf

# LOCAL: these sources are include_str!-embedded by source-text-scanning tests
# (agent::config guard tests match "\n}\n" struct bodies); a CRLF checkout
# (core.autocrlf=true) makes those scans fail. Same rationale as the assets above.
crates/codegen/xai-grok-shell/src/agent/config.rs text eol=lf
crates/codegen/xai-grok-shell/src/agent/mvp_agent/mod.rs text eol=lf
